1
00:00:04,299 --> 00:00:07,039
On race day, we see only a few minutes of speed.

2
00:00:07,039 --> 00:00:09,094
Behind them are months of hard work.

3
00:00:11,194 --> 00:00:13,872
Chennai, Coimbatore, Greater Noida.

4
00:00:13,872 --> 00:00:17,545
India's racing industry grew up on these tracks.

5
00:00:19,645 --> 00:00:22,431
The journey starts young, in go-karting.

6
00:00:22,431 --> 00:00:26,193
Weekends, holidays, festivals, all spent at the track.

7
00:00:28,293 --> 00:00:33,634
To handle the cornering forces and the heat of the cockpit, drivers train hard every single day.

8
00:00:35,734 --> 00:00:40,296
Before ever reaching the track, they practise hundreds of laps on the simulator.

9
00:00:42,396 --> 00:00:46,367
After every lap they study the data, chasing even a fraction of a second.

10
00:00:48,467 --> 00:00:52,658
The mechanics start before sunrise, and their work often goes past midnight.

11
00:00:54,758 --> 00:00:58,046
One second lost in a pit stop can change the whole race.

12
00:00:58,046 --> 00:00:59,983
So they practise again and again.

13
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:06,617
Thousands of kilometres by truck, loaded with cars, tyres and tools.

14
00:01:06,617 --> 00:01:09,084
Some go all the way to tracks abroad.

15
00:01:11,184 --> 00:01:13,746
A trophy on the podium is never one person's win.

16
00:01:13,746 --> 00:01:16,466
It is the reward for a whole team's years of effort.

